// NON-LIBRARY UNCHECKED right-unit projection join at q_unit_hom_units.
// id_Q(A) may expose its actual Unit-curry body before the generic stable
// postcomposition point rule sees the identity. Retain that same unit law
// on this body; do not fold arbitrary postcomposition to raw composition.
// The repeated A is the actual unit endpoint, matching the represented
// right-unit owner. No mirrored precomposition clause is selected here.
rule @hom_postcomp_fapp0 Prof_cov_universe Prof_cov_universe
      (@id Cat_cat Prof_cov_universe) $A $A $B $P
      (@hom_precomp_along_fapp0 Cat_cat Cat_cat (@id Cat_cat Cat_cat)
        _ _ _
        (@Product_pair_tele_func $A (Op_cat $A))
        (@hom_postcomp_func Cat_cat Cat_cat (@id Cat_cat Cat_cat)
          _ _ _ (@Unit_prof (Op_cat $A))))
  ↪ $P;
